---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

{/* One page for both languages: GitHub Pages serves this one 404.html for any address. */}
<Base locale="en" title="Page not found" description="The page you are looking for may have moved." noindex>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Page not found</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted">
    The page you are looking for may have moved, or the address may be wrong.{' '}
    <a href="/" class="text-brand hover:underline">Back to the home page</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted" lang="ja">
    お探しのページは移動したか、アドレスが間違っている可能性があります。<a href="/ja/" class="text-brand hover:underline">トップページへ</a>
  </p>
</Base>
